+    <div class="layout">
+      <article id="article">
+        <header class="article-header">
+          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> PYTHON 实践指南 <span class="issue">VOL. 005</span></div>
+          <h1>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 <span>5 个技巧</span></h1>
+          <p class="dek">把重复的表格工作交给代码，<br class="desktop-break">让每一份报表，都少一点手动，多一点从容。</p>
+          <div class="article-meta"><span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">码</span><span class="author">码间编辑部</span><span class="meta-divider"></span><time datetime="2026-10-26">2026 年 10 月 26 日</time><span class="reading-time"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7"/><path d="M10 5.5V10l3 2"/></svg>约 8 分钟</span></div>
+          <div class="tags"><a href="#tip-1">Python</a><a href="#tip-2">pandas</a><a href="#tip-5">Excel 自动化</a><span>从入门到实用</span></div>
+        </header>
+
+        <div class="hero-art" aria-label="将 Excel 数据转化为 Python 自动化报表的示意图" role="img">
+          <div class="hero-label">LESS REPETITION. MORE CREATION.</div>
+          <div class="sheet-art"><div class="sheet-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>monthly_report.xlsx</span></div><div class="sheet-grid"><span></span><b>A</b><b>B</b><b>C</b><b>1</b><span>产品</span><span>销量</span><span>销售额</span><b>2</b><span>键盘</span><span>128</span><span>25,600</span><b>3</b><span>鼠标</span><span>256</span><span>12,800</span><b>4</b><span>显示器</span><span>64</span><span class="selected">76,800</span></div></div>
+          <div class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">⟶</div>
+          <div class="python-art"><span class="terminal-dots">● ● ●</span><span class="py-badge">.py</span><div><span class="code-purple">import</span> pandas <span class="code-purple">as</span> pd<br><br><span class="code-gray"># 让报表自己完成</span><br>df.<span class="code-yellow">to_excel</span>(<span class="code-green">"done.xlsx"</span>)<br><span class="terminal-cursor"></span></div></div>
+          <div class="art-footer"><span>EXCEL × PYTHON</span><span>重复工作，至此结束 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
